    "directions": [
      "Take fresh bread slices, trim the edges, transfer it to a mixer grinder jar and grind it until crumbly.",
      "In a pan, add fresh bread crumbs, salt to taste and toss it on low flames until golden in color.",
      "Add semolina and give it a good mix..",
      "In a pan, add oil, once it's hot, add mustard seeds, curry leaves and let it splutter.",
      "Add green chillies, ketchup, water and simmer it for a minute.",
      "Transfer it to a bowl and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add mayonnaise, garlic, dry oregano, chili flakes and give it a good mix.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add gram flour, refined flour, salt to taste, turmeric powder, degi red chili powder, curd, ginger garlic paste, water and make a smooth batter.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add gram flour, refined flour and mix it well.",
      "Add salt to taste, degi red chili powder, black pepper powder and give it a good mix.",
      "Cut onions into roundels and separate the layers.",
      "Coat the onion rings in a dry mixture, dip it into batter and coat it well evenly.",
      "Transfer it to bread crumbs and crumb coat it well. Transfer it to a plate and keep it aside for further use.",
      "Heat oil in a kadhai, add onion rings, fry it until crispy and golden brown.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and serve hot with prepared dips."
    ],
